T* (their free exercise claim.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3. Requirements for preliminary injunctive relief) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Where a district court has denied a motion for a) Tj
T* (preliminary injunction, we may order the injunction to) Tj
T* (issue if "the four factors required to grant a preliminary) Tj
T* (injunction are apparent on the record before us." Tanimura) Tj
T* (& Antle, Inc. v. Packed Fresh Produce, Inc., 222 F.3d 132,) Tj
T* (140 \(3d Cir. 2000\); see also Council of Alternative Political) Tj
T* (Parties v. Hooks, 121 F.3d 876, 883-84 \(3d Cir. 1997\);) Tj
T* (Polaroid Corp. v. Disney, 862 F.2d 987, 1006 \(3d Cir. 1988\).) Tj
T* (_________________________________________________________________) Tj
T* () Tj
